@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Passenger collection: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers

### Combined text filter, date range, sorting and pagination: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers?name=Олена&birthFrom=1980-01-01&birthTo=2005-12-31&sort=birthDate&order=DESC&offset=0&limit=5

### Existing passenger: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/PP10001

### Create passenger: 201 with Location (run once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{"passportSeriesNum":"LAB7-001","fullName":"Марія Коваленко","birthDate":"2000-05-12"}

### Duplicate passenger: 409 (run after the creation above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{"passportSeriesNum":"LAB7-001","fullName":"Марія Коваленко","birthDate":"2000-05-12"}

### Update passenger: 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/LAB7-001
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{"passportSeriesNum":"LAB7-001","fullName":"Марія Петренко","birthDate":"2000-05-12"}

### Updated passenger: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/LAB7-001

### Passenger statistics: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/stats

### Delete passenger: 204, empty body
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/LAB7-001

### Missing passenger: 404 (run after DELETE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/LAB7-001

### Passenger validation: 400 with all violations
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{"passportSeriesNum":"","fullName":"","birthDate":null}

### Malformed JSON: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: application/json

{"passportSeriesNum":

### Unsupported Content-Type: 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers
Content-Type: text/plain

{"passportSeriesNum":"NEW","fullName":"Ivan","birthDate":"2000-05-12"}

### Invalid query value: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers?limit=abc

### Unknown sort: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers?sort=unknown

### Invalid order: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers?order=SIDEWAYS

### Unsupported collection method: 405
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers

### Unsupported item method: 405
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/PP10001
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Identity change is forbidden: 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/passengers/PP10001
Content-Type: application/json

{"passportSeriesNum":"DIFFERENT","fullName":"Марія","birthDate":"2000-05-12"}

### Flight collection: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights

### Combined flight text and departure filters: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights?number=PS-&departureFrom=2026-11-02T00:00:00&departureTo=2026-11-04T00:00:00&sort=departureTime&order=DESC&limit=5&offset=0

### Existing flight: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights/PS-101

### Create flight: 201 with Location (run once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber":"LAB7-701",
  "departureAirport":{"iataCode":"KBP","cityName":"Київ"},
  "arrivalAirport":{"iataCode":"WAW","cityName":"Варшава"},
  "departureTime":"2026-12-01T10:00:00",
  "arrivalTime":"2026-12-01T12:00:00",
  "status":"SCHEDULED"
}

### Duplicate flight: 409 (run after the creation above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNumber":"LAB7-701",
  "departureAirport":{"iataCode":"KBP","cityName":"Київ"},
  "arrivalAirport":{"iataCode":"WAW","cityName":"Варшава"},
  "departureTime":"2026-12-01T10:00:00",
  "arrivalTime":"2026-12-01T12:00:00",
  "status":"SCHEDULED"
}

